  "docs.d0019": "404 artifact_not_found: artifact_id does not exist, does not belong to the current tenant, or refers to an artifact that is no longer available.\n\n413 response_too_large: the file exceeds the transfer size limit.\n\n401 invalid_api_key: the Authorization header is missing, is not in Bearer format, or contains an invalid / revoked API Key.\n\n429 requests_per_minute / tokens_per_minute / max_concurrent (type is rate_limit_error): this tenant's quota is exceeded. The response includes a Retry-After header in seconds.\n\n503 verification_unavailable: API Key validation is temporarily unavailable; try again later.\n\n503 connection_failed / runtime_closed: the execution backend responsible for this job is temporarily unavailable.\n\n504 timeout: the execution backend timed out.\n\n502 upstream_error: the execution backend returned an error.",
