  "docs.d0484": "JSON Schema when type is json_schema.",
  "docs.d0485": "When true, saves this conversation turn so the returned id can be used as previous_response_id for continuation. Returns 400 if session storage is disabled in the deployment.",
  "docs.d0486": "ID of the previous response, which must have been requested with store=true. The server automatically prepends earlier conversation history. Returns 400 if the id does not exist.",
